-- Phong Than "Lenh Bai Huy Do" (magicscript 61002, 2026-09-30): permanent, unlimited uses
-- (KItemList::ExecuteScript only calls main; this script never removes the item).
-- Opens an NPC shop right where the player stands: KBuySell::OpenSale records the player's own
-- map/position and KPlayer's sell handler only checks that the player has not moved since, so bag
-- items can be sold ("Ban" button) anywhere. Shop 1 = medicine shop (few goods).
-- No top-level dofile: loose scripts are registered with cwd = their own folder.

function main(nItemIdx)
	Msg2Player("L\214nh B\181i H\241y \167\229: \174\183 m\235 c\246a h\181ng. B\202m n\243t B\184n r\229i click v\181o \174\229 trong t\243i \174\211 b\184n. \167\248ng y\170n t\185i ch\231 cho t\237i khi b\184n xong.")
	Sale(1)
	return 0
end
